# Text, so that a checkout on any platform gets the same bytes and diffs stay
# readable. Everything else is left to git's own detection.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, so git does not try to diff or merge them and a `git grep` does not
# wade through megabytes of pixels and weights.
*.png binary
*.icns binary
*.bin binary
*.mlmodelc binary

# Not part of what somebody downloads a release for.
docs/images/* linguist-documentation
*.md linguist-documentation
